{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122223","id":5101568187,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc78le1X","number":122223,"title":"Core: Fix UndoRedo silently dropping Callables bound to global functions","user":{"login":"Empt-y","id":287933136,"node_id":"U_kgDOESmC0A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287933136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y","html_url":"https://github.com/Empt-y","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-09T08:16:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T15:23:19Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T15:20:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122223","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122223.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122223.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #107727\n\n`UndoRedo::_process_operation_list()` treated any operation whose `Object` lookup failed as \"the bound object was deleted, skip it\" and silently continued. That assumption doesn't hold for Callables that were never bound to an `Object` in the first place — a GDScript reference to a global/utility function (`print`, `randomize`, `seed`, etc.) has `GDScriptUtilityCallable::get_object()` always return an empty `ObjectID` by design. The result: `add_do_method(print.bind(...))` and similar were silently no-ops instead of running, as reported in #107727.\n\nOnly skip the operation when it previously had a valid, now-deleted object, so callables that were never object-bound still execute.\n\n## Test plan\n- Reproduced the exact silent-drop behavior from #107727 on current master (`print.bind(\"finished!\")` never fired), confirmed the fix resolves it in a real headless run, not just a compile check.\n- Verified no regression on the original \"object was deleted\" protection this code exists for: both the add-time validity check (`add_do_method` rejecting an already-freed object's callable) and the mid-list case (an object freed by an earlier operation in the same action, then referenced by a later one) still safely no-op instead of crashing.","closed_by":{"login":"Empt-y","id":287933136,"node_id":"U_kgDOESmC0A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287933136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y","html_url":"https://github.com/Empt-y","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Empt-y/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122223/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}